  _title: Assistente Municipal por IA
  _titleEn: AI City Assistant
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Assistentes com intelig\xEAncia artificial respondem d\xFAvidas dos
    moradores a qualquer hora e aliviam o atendimento."
  _summaryEn: AI assistants answer residents' questions at any hour and ease the
    load on service desks.
  _realWorld: "Em 2024, o jornal The Markup mostrou que o chatbot MyCity, de Nova
    York, orientava empres\xE1rios a descumprir leis da pr\xF3pria cidade."
  _realWorldEn: In 2024 The Markup showed that New York's MyCity chatbot was advising
    business owners to break the city's own laws.
  _tradeOffs: "Respostas erradas podem prejudicar quem confia nelas, e \xE9 preciso
    definir quem responde pelo erro."
  _tradeOffsEn: Wrong answers can harm people who rely on them, and someone must
    be accountable for the error.
  _sources:
  - Label: The Markup (2024)
    Url: https://themarkup.org/news/2024/03/29/nycs-ai-chatbot-tells-businesses-to-break-the-law
